rce_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a ) “Ryukyu Islands” means the territory, including territorial  \nwaters and overlying airspace, to which Executive Order No. 10713  \nof June 5,1957, as amended, applies.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b ) “Act” means the Federal Aviation Act of 1958 (72 Stat. 731,  \n49 U.S.C. 1301 et seq.), as amended.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) “Board” means the Civil Aeronautics Board.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 1(c)","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec1(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(d ) “High Commissioner” means the High Commissioner of the  \nRyukyu Islands.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 1(d)","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec1(d)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S e c. 2. The provisions of Titles IV , V III, IX , X , and Section 1108 \n(b ) of the Act, together with the related definitions in Section 101  \nthereof, are extended to the Ryukyu Islands insofar as applicable to  \nthe economic regulation by the Board of civil air transportation orig­\ninating in thé Ryukyu Islands and terminating elsewhere, or termi­\nnating in the Ryukyu Islands and originating elsewhere, or transiting  \nthe Ryukyu Islands.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 2","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S e c. 3. The provisions of Title Y I I  of the Act are extended to the  \nRyukyu Islands for all purposes.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 3","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S e c. 4. Before taking action on any application filed pursuant to  \nthe Act as extended by this order, the Board shall obtain and consider  \nthe views of the High Commissioner concerning such application.  \nThe High Commissioner shall promptly provide such views to the  \nBoard on request.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 4","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S e c. 5. A ll presently outstanding orders, authorizations, and regu­\nlations applicable to the Ryukyu Islands, heretofore entered by the  \nBoard under the Act or by a predecessor agency under the Civil Aero­\nnautics Act of 1938 (52 Stat. 973), are hereby ratified and confirmed.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 5","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec5","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S e c. 6. The High Commissioner shall control and regulate aviation  \nwithin the Ryukyu Islands except as provided in Sections 2 and 3.  \nThe Board and the Administrator of the Federal Aviation Agency  \nshall furnish the High Commissioner such technical advice and as­\nsistance, pursuant to interagency agreement, as he shall require to  \ncarry out this responsibility.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 6","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec6","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"S e c. 7. The Ryukyu Islands are removed from the applicability  \nof Executive Order No. 10854 of November 27, 1959.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5; Sec. 7","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:11326#sec7","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"32 FR 2841, PDF pages 5-5","sha256":"fa804173b757e689b9036e82cff43ad1f1badfde62dd479648524464f2ce5195","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1967-02-14/pdf/FR-1967-02-14.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 10 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:11326"}
